# The packaged extension is the two bundles in out/ plus the static
# files VS Code reads directly. Everything else stays out.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!language-configuration.json
!out/extension.js
!out/server.js
!syntaxes/*.json
!snippets/*.json
!themes/*.json
!icons/icon.png
!icons/omg.svg
!icons/omgb.svg
!images/*.png
